DCGM C API headers vendored for monitor builds that link against libdcgm but do not
have a system dcgm-dev / datacenter-gpu-manager-devel package (typical on minimal
ARM images or static-bundle workflows).

Source repository (archived; headers remain the public C API surface the Go bindings
used for cgo):

  https://github.com/NVIDIA/gpu-monitoring-tools

Path in that tree: bindings/go/dcgm/

Pinned snapshot commit: 5a2c58442e48254950178d0c2693ba45b297034b

Files copied (include order is dcgm_agent.h -> dcgm_structs.h -> dcgm_fields.h):

  dcgm_agent.h
  dcgm_structs.h
  dcgm_fields.h

License: Apache-2.0 (see SPDX headers in each file).

Runtime: you still need a compatible libdcgm from NVIDIA DCGM; headers only satisfy
the compiler. Mismatch between header and library versions can cause build or runtime
issues; prefer system headers when your distro ships them.
